  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "287b8151e782e989",
      "translationZh": "计算机操作智能体不需要由一个大型模型来执行所有认知功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "760019d964c79e4e",
      "translationZh": "认知分片（Cognitive Sharding）将智能体的功能分配给多个专门模型，再通过由代码掌控的控制平面协调它们。当前实现使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "145ee778276c6238",
      "translationZh": "Bonsai 2 27B，用于推理和规划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09898f706d1f2daf",
      "translationZh": "基于 Qwen3.5 4B 构建的 Kev 4B，用于快速选择动作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7afd3c7b7fdb9e3e",
      "translationZh": "UI-Mate 9B，用于视觉定位",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0a4b79d265fa576",
      "translationZh": "控制平面负责管理执行状态、模型驻留、验证、重试和恢复。模型接收的是范围受限的决策任务，而不是对智能体循环的无限制控制权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12ba6bb404d050cc",
      "translationZh": "这种分离改变了硬件需求。模型可以根据当前执行阶段，以事务方式加载和卸载。因此，该系统能够在一台 16 GB 消费级计算机的内存限制内运行完整的本地计算机操作技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de340b82effcab43",
      "translationZh": "这与混合专家模型不同。这些分片是相互独立的模型，具有不同的输入、训练目标、运行时和权限。它们在系统层面组合，而不是在单个神经网络内部组合。方案文档介绍了规划器–选择器–定位器架构、候选项构建、受限执行、经环境验证的恢复，以及考虑内存约束的模型驻留。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86c7c5d8207e4f86",
      "translationZh": "我在这里补充了更多细节：https://github.com/off-grid-ai/cognitive-sharding#cognitive-sharding-a-systems-architecture-for-computer-use-on-consumer-hardware",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed0f0874801087bc",
      "translationZh": "接下来会用更多基准测试对它进行评测，并将很快公布结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5733c8a937283ba",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/alichherawalla 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
